cff-version: 1.2.0
type: software
title: "RuralVet-LLM: Korean Rural Veterinary AI Assistant via LoRA/QLoRA Fine-tuning and Multi-method Quantization"
abstract: |
  A comprehensive research project implementing Phase 0-2 experiments on Korean-language
  veterinary AI assistant using Qwen3.5-4B. This work encompasses zero-shot baseline measurement,
  6-experiment LoRA/QLoRA fine-tuning (3 ranks × 2 methods), and 7-way quantization comparison
  (FP16, Float8, 8bit, 4bit-NF4, 4bit-PureFloat, 2bit-HQQ) with real-world deployment scenario
  analysis for rural areas (VRAM ≤5.4GB achieved).

